The Python package (src/antstreet) bundles no third-party code.

The project site (site/) is built from these third-party components. None of them is part of the
Python package, and none is distributed except inside the built site.

- GSAP 3 with ScrollTrigger and CustomEase (https://gsap.com), the site's animation library.
  GSAP Standard "No Charge" License: https://gsap.com/standard-license
  Free to use, including commercially. It is not an OSI-approved open-source licence: it may not
  be used in a tool that competes with Webflow's visual animation builder, which the site is not.
- Lenis (https://github.com/darkroomengineering/lenis), smooth scrolling. MIT License.
- Astro (https://astro.build), the site generator. MIT License. Build-time only.
- Fonts, subsetted and self-hosted in site/public/fonts/, all under the SIL Open Font License 1.1
  (https://openfontlicense.org):
  - Bricolage Grotesque, Copyright 2022 The Bricolage Grotesque Project Authors
  - JetBrains Mono, Copyright 2020 The JetBrains Mono Project Authors
  - Noto Sans Arabic (the Arabic-Indic digits only), Copyright 2022 The Noto Project Authors
